## PART 8 — Tests, then a report

Vitest, following existing test conventions:

- State machine: every legal transition passes, every illegal one throws. Cover role checks — a customer cannot mark work complete, a provider cannot confirm completion.
- Credits: debit on booking, refund on decline, refund on cancel, no double-debit on a retried submit, no double-credit on a replayed Yoco webhook.
- RLS: a customer cannot read another customer's booking, files, or messages; a provider cannot read a booking they are not party to; an unauthenticated request gets nothing.
- Uploads: type and size rejection server-side, signed URL issued only to parties to the booking.
- Reviews: cannot review an incomplete booking, cannot review twice, cannot review someone else's booking, aggregates recompute correctly when a review is hidden.
- Commission: bracket selection at each boundary, read from config not hardcoded.

